      <p begin="01:46.200" end="01:48.850" ttm:agent="v1">I cannot leave a trace, but I think I gotta go</p>
      <p begin="01:48.850" end="01:51.650" ttm:agent="v1">Spillin' blood, it's a race, and I'm always needin' more</p>
      <p begin="01:51.650" end="01:54.350" ttm:agent="v1">Homicide on my mind, why you think you 'bout to die?</p>
      <p begin="01:54.350" end="01:57.050" ttm:agent="v1">See the Freddie in your room and you're 'bout to meet the doom</p>
      <p begin="01:57.050" end="02:00.080" ttm:agent="v1">Pop it, pop it, pop it, pop it, pop it, pop it, pop it, now I'm</p>
      <p begin="02:00.080" end="02:02.520" ttm:agent="v1">Pop-pop-pop-pop-pop-pop-pop-pop-pop-pop, spree</p>
